rm 2025 : Important Question\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When will the online application for <strong>Control Board CPCB Various Post\u00a0Recruitment 2025</strong>\u00a0Start?</span></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> The online application for this recruitment has started On <strong>07 </strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">April 2025</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the last date for online application for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Control Board CPCB Various Post</strong></span><strong>\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The last date for online application Form is <strong>28 April 2025</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What is the age limit for <strong>Control Board CPCB Various Post</strong><strong>\u00a0Bharti 2025</strong>?</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The age limit for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Control Board CPCB Various Post</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>\u00a0Bharti 2025</strong></span>\u00a0is as follows:</span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 14pt;\">The minimum age is <strong>18 Years</strong> and the maximum age is <strong>30 years.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Control Board CPCB Various Post</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>Vacancy 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:\u00a0 </strong>Candidates must have a <strong>3-year full-time B.Sc. degree with Physics and Mathematics</strong></span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>OR</strong> a <strong>Bachelor\u2019s degree in Engineering</strong> (with Physics &amp; Math in at least one semester).</span><br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">They should also have passed <strong>English</strong> as a subject in either <strong>10th or 12th class</strong>, showing basic spoken and written English skills.</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>CPCB </b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <b>CPCB </b>is https://cpcb.nic.in/</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"CPCB Various Post Answer Key Notice 2025\" class=\"size-full wp-image-21247 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"473\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/CPCB-Recruitment-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/CPCB-Recruitment-1.jpg 900w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/CPCB-Recruitment-1-300x158.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/CPCB-Recruitment-1-768x404.jpg 768w\" width=\"900\"/></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.cm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download English Vocab App</a></strong></p>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"77ee9eb9e3017522668e3749-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"77ee9eb9e3017522668e3749-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%; padding: 10px; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><h3>Latest Posts</h3><p><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/csbc-bihar-prohibition-constable-2026/\">Bihar\u00a0Police Prohibition Constable Result 2026</a></p><p><a hre